# A1/A1.1/A1_06_hobbies_and_time.letz
# Source: Quizlet "A1 Basics Beginner Luxembourgish Lesson 6"
#   https://quizlet.com/_h2swbj
# Bracket alternatives like "(with me)" split into multiple @en variants.
# Fills added: time telling (vir/op/hallwer), frequency adverbs, modal verbs,
# prepositions (um/virum/am), and the gär liking scale.

@lesson A1.06 "Hobbies & Time"

# --- Hobby activity phrases (Quizlet cards 3-14) ---
@word Bicher liesen = to read books
@word schwamme goen = to go swimming
@word an de Kino goen = to go to the cinema
@word Tëlee kucken = to watch TV
@word danze goen = to go dancing
@word spadséiere goen = to go for a walk
@word um Internet surfen = to surf the web
@word Lëtzebuergesch léieren = to learn Luxembourgish
@word lafe goen = to go for a run
@word mat senge Kanner spillen = to play with one's children
@word Musek lauschteren = to listen to music

# --- Single-word entry (Quizlet card 49) ---
@word Genau! = Exactly!

# --- Vocabulary from sentences (coverage backfill) ---
@word d'Auer = hour
@word de Mount = month
@word d'Woch = week
@word de Restaurant = restaurant
@word dacks = often
@word heiansdo = sometimes
@word léiwer = rather
@word moies = in the morning
@word treffen = to meet
@word sichen = to look for
@word fléien = to fly
@word retten = to rescue

# --- Sentences (Quizlet cards 1-2, 15-48, 50-52) ---

